false},"_title":"Call to action"},"elements":[{"id":"aa455b","elType":"widget","widgetType":"button","settings":{"text":"Talk to us","link":{"url":"/contact-us/","is_external":"","nofollow":"","custom_attributes":"","label":""},"typography_typography":"custom","typography_font_size":{"unit":"px","size":14.5,"sizes":[]},"typography_font_weight":"600","typography_line_height":{"unit":"em","size":1.72,"sizes":[]},"border_radius":{"unit":"px","top":"None","right":"None","bottom":"None","left":"None","isLinked":false},"text_padding":{"unit":"px","top":"11","right":"21","bottom":"11","left":"21","isLinked":false},"_css_classes":"ml-btn-primary","_title":"Main button","__globals__":{"background_color":"globals/colors?id=primary"}},"elements":[]}]}]}]},{"id":"abb88f","elType":"container","settings":{"padding":{"unit":"px","top":"92","right":"30","bottom":"92","left":"30","isLinked":false},"padding_mobile":{"unit":"px","top":"56","right":"30","bottom":"56","left":"30","isLinked":false},"flex_gap":{"unit":"px","size":"0","column":"0","row":"0","isLinked":true},"flex_align_items":"stretch","_element_id":"why","css_classes":"ml-inner  ml-band-warm","_title":"Why this industry"},"elements":[{"id":"aafef5","elType":"container","settings":{"flex_gap":{"unit":"px","size":"0","column":"0","row":"0","isLinked":true},"flex_align_items":"stretch","width":{"unit":"%","size":100},"padding":{"unit":"px","top":"0","right":"0","bottom":"0","left":"0","isLinked":false},"css_classes":"ml-section-head ml-reveal","_title":"Section heading"},"elements":[{"id":"aac117","elType":"widget","widgetType":"heading","settings":{"title":"Content and language services for research organizations and think tanks","header_size":"h6","align":"center","_css_classes":"ml-label ml-label-centred","_title":"Label"},"elements":[]},{"id":"aae006","elType":"widget","widgetType":"heading","settings":{"title":"Attract media, researchers, and policymakers to your work","header_size":"h2","align":"center","_title":"Heading","__globals__":{"title_color":"globals/colors?id=secondary","typography_typography":"globals/typography?id=primary"}},"elements":[]}]},{"id":"ab1de4","elType":"widget","widgetType":"text-editor","settings":{"editor":"<p>Research institutes and think tanks play a vital role in shaping our future, especially in fields like sustainability, social equity, business, and economics. We have worked with all these fields.</p>","_css_classes":"ml-lead-body ml-reveal ml-reveal-1","_title":"The case"},"elements":[]},{"id":"ab3cd3","elType":"widget","widgetType":"text-editor","settings":{"editor":"<p>These organizations' groundbreaking work, or even their incremental efforts, can ignite change, influence policies, and drive innovation. But are you effectively communicating these complex ideas to a global audience? Are the right eyes seeing your work?</p>","_css_classes":"ml-lead-body ml-reveal ml-reveal-2","_title":"The case"},"elements":[]},{"id":"ab5bc2","elType":"widget","widgetType":"text-editor","settings":{"editor":"<p>Attention is earned through clear, compelling, and scientifically accurate messaging. Complex concepts need to be translated into relatable narratives. We need to show the impacts of your research. Make this knowledge accessible and compelling – you'll create action, and please your donors.</p>","_css_classes":"ml-lead-body ml-reveal ml-reveal-3","_title":"The case"},"elements":[]},{"id":"ab7ab1","elType":"widget","widgetType":"text-editor","settings":{"editor":"<p>It's even more challenging in a less &#8220;hot&#8221; and headline-making area, such as adaptation or micro-financing.</p>","_css_classes":"ml-lead-body ml-reveal ml-reveal-3","_title":"The case"},"elements":[]},{"id":"ab99a0","elType":"widget","widgetType":"text-editor","settings":{"editor":"<p>We'll help you create strong communication – both in strategy and quality output. We'll also help you compete in online searches because Google values your authority. We'll reach beyond academia and government, into the public domain, and get your work in front of decision-making spheres.</p>","_css_classes":"ml-lead-body ml-reveal ml-reveal-3","_title":"The case"},"elements":[]}]},{"id":"ac7229","elType":"container","settings":{"padding":{"unit":"px","top":"92","right":"30","bottom":"92","left":"30","isLinked":false},"padding_mobile":{"unit":"px","top":"56","right":"30","bottom":"56","left":"30","isLinked":false},"flex_gap":{"unit":"px","size":"0","column":"0","row":"0","isLinked":true},"flex_align_items":"stretch","_element_id":"case-study","css_classes":"ml-inner","_title":"Case study"},"elements":[{"id":"ac533a","elType":"container","settings":{"width":{"unit":"%","size":100},"padding":{"unit":"px","top":"0","right":"0","bottom":"0","left":"0","isLinked":false},"css_classes":"ml-cs ml-cs-solo ml-reveal","_title":"Case study"},"elements":[{"id":"ac344b","elType":"container","settings":{"flex_gap":{"unit":"px","size":"0","column":"0","row":"0","isLinked":true},"padding":{"unit":"px","top":"0","right":"0","bottom":"0","left":"0","isLinked":false},"width":{"unit":"%","size":100},"css_classes":"ml-cs-words","_title":"The words"},"elements":[{"id":"abd77e","elType":"widget","widgetType":"heading","settings":{"title":"CASE STUDY","header_size":"h6","_css_classes":"ml-label","_title":"Label"},"elements":[]},{"id":"abf66d","elType":"widget","widgetType":"heading","settings":{"title":"Climate Change Performance Index","header_size":"h3","_css_classes":"ml-cs-head","_title":"Client","__globals__":{"title_color":"globals/colors?id=secondary","typography_typography":"globals/typography?id=primary"}},"elements":[]},{"id":"ac155c","elType":"widget","widgetType":"text-editor","settings":{"editor":"<p>The Climate Change Performance Index (CCPI) is an influential and detailed annual ranking of how well major countries are keeping up their end of the deal is countering climate change. The report relies on national experts and quantifies performance with numerous metrics. MacroLingo annually edits this full report, making sure the language is accurate, aligned, and localized. We also give guidance on SEO to help the commissioning organization reach media, policymakers, students, and others who need to see this honest and valuable assessment.</p>","_css_classes":"ml-cs-val","_title":"What we did"},"elements":[]}]}]}]},{"id":"aedcd5","elType":"container","settings":{"padding":{"unit":"px","top":"92","right":"30","bottom":"92","left":"30","isLinked":false},"padding_mobile":{"unit":"px","top":"56","right":"30","bottom":"56","left":"30","isLinked":false},"flex_gap":{"unit":"px","size":"0","column":"0","row":"0","isLinked":true},"flex_align_items":"stretch","_element_id":"services","css_classes":"ml-inner  ml-band-blue","_title":"Services"},"elements":[{"id":"ae422a","elType":"container","settings":{"flex_gap":{"unit":"px","size":"0","column":"0","row":"0","isLinked":true},"flex_align_items":"stretch","width":{"unit":"%","size":100},"padding":{"unit":"px","top":"0","right":"0","bottom":"0","left":"0","isLinked":false},"css_classes":"ml-section-head ml-reveal","_title":"Section heading"},"elements":[{"id":"ae044c","elType":"widget","widgetType":"heading","settings":{"title":"What we do","header_size":"h6","align":"center","_css_classes":"ml-label ml-label-centred","_title":"Label"},"elements":[]},{"id":"ae233b","elType":"widget","widgetType":"heading","settings":{"title":"Get readers, funders, and attention","header_size":"h2","align":"center","_title":"Heading","__globals__":{"title_color":"globals/colors?id=secondary","typography_typography":"globals/typography?id=primary"}},"elements":[]}]},{"id":"ae6119","elType":"widget","widgetType":"text-editor","settings":{"editor":"<p>For nongovernmental (NGO) and nonprofit (NPO) organizations, some of our services are…</p>","_css_classes":"ml-lead ml-reveal ml-reveal-1","_title":"Intro"},"elements":[]},{"id":"ae8008","elType":"container","settings":{"flex_direction":"row","flex_gap":{"unit":"px","size":"22","column":"22","row":"22","isLinked":true},"flex_wrap":"wrap","width":{"unit":"%","size":100},"padding":{"unit":"px","top":"0","right":"0","bottom":"0","left":"0","isLinked":false},"flex_align_items":"stretch","css_classes":"ml-svc-grid ml-reveal ml-reveal-2","_title":"The services"},"elements":[{"id":"acede5","elType":"container","settings":{"width":{"unit":"%","size":100},"flex_gap":{"unit":"px","size":"0","column":"0","row":"0","isLinked":true},"css_classes":"ml-svc","_title":"Writing (and translation) for your research"},"elements":[{"id":"ac9118","elType":"widget","widgetType":"heading","settings":{"title":"Writing (and translation) for your research","header_size":"h3","_css_classes":"ml-svc-title","_title":"Service","__globals__":{"title_color":"globals/colors?id=secondary","typography_typography":"globals/typography?id=primary"}},"elements":[]},{"id":"acb007","elType":"widget","widgetType":"text-editor","settings":{"editor":"<p>MacroLingo clients receive nuanced writing that captures the essence of complex topics like climate change and regional conflict. We can summarize reports on new sustainable technologies or rewrite them to appeal to international stakeholders and investors.</p>","_css_classes":"ml-svc-note","_title":"What it is"},"elements":[]},{"id":"accef6","elType":"widget","widgetType":"text-editor","settings":{"editor":"<p>This not only expands the reach of your research but also attracts global attention and support, helping to drive innovation and action. We can also work with source materials in Japanese and other languages.</p>","_css_classes":"ml-svc-note","_title":"What it is"},"elements":[]}]},{"id":"ad69a1","elType":"container","settings":{"width":{"unit":"%","size":100},"flex_gap":{"unit":"px","size":"0","column":"0","row":"0","isLinked":true},"css_classes":"ml-svc","_title":"Research organization SEO and Web planning"},"elements":[{"id":"ad0cd4","elType":"widget","widgetType":"heading","settings":{"title":"Research organization SEO and Web planning","header_size":"h3","_css_classes":"ml-svc-title","_title":"Service","__globals__":{"title_color":"globals/colors?id=secondary","typography_typography":"globals/typography?id=primary"}},"elements":[]},{"id":"ad2bc3","elType":"widget","widgetType":"text-editor","settings":{"editor":"<p>Many research organizations lack the time and human resources to consider SEO. But, without SEO and web planning, your superb research may never be found online. We make your findings more discoverable and accessible.</p>","_css_classes":"ml-svc-note","_title":"What it is"},"elements":[]},{"id":"ad4ab2","elType":"widget","widgetType":"text-editor","settings":{"editor":"<p>For instance, if your organization has developed a new model for economic growth that prioritizes social equity, we can increase your visibility among policymakers, academic circles, and the general public. This greater online presence not only promotes your work but also positions your organization as a thought leader.</p>","_css_classes":"ml-svc-note","_title":"What it is"},"elements":[]}]},{"id":"ade55d","elType":"container","settings":{"width":{"unit":"%","size":100},"flex_gap":{"unit":"px","size":"0","column":"0","row":"0","isLinked":true},"css_classes":"ml-svc","_title":"Scientific and academic editing for publication"},"elements":[{"id":"ad8890","elType":"widget","widgetType":"heading","settings":{"title":"Scientific and academic editing for publication","header_size":"h3","_css_classes":"ml-svc-title","_title":"Service","__globals__":{"title_color":"globals/colors?id=secondary","typography_typography":"globals/typography?id=primary"}},"elements":[]},{"id":"ada77f","elType":"widget","widgetType":"text-editor","settings":{"editor":"<p>Led by a board-certified editor, MacroLingo reviews and refines scientific content, ensuring clarity, accuracy, and adherence to specific guidelines and general standards. Our editing service can transform this complex analysis into an accessible and engaging document without losing the scientific rigor.</p>","_css_classes":"ml-svc-note","_title":"What it is"},"elements":[]},{"id":"adc66e","elType":"widget","widgetType":"text-editor","settings":{"editor":"<p>This makes your research more approachable for a wider audience, including those outside your specialized scientific and research community. This increases its impact and facilitates broader discussions and understanding of your key issues.</p>","_css_classes":"ml-svc-note","_title":"What it is"},"elements":[]}]}]},{"id":"aebde6","elType":"container","settings":{"width":{"unit":"%","size":100},"css_classes":"ml-cta-centred ml-reveal ml-reveal-3","_title":"Call to action"},"elements":[{"id":"ae9ef7","elType":"widget","widgetType":"button","settings":{"text":"Talk to us about your project","link":{"url":"/contact-us/","is_external":"","nofollow":"","custom_attributes":"","label":""},"typography_typography":"custom","typography_font_size":{"unit":"px","size":14.5,"sizes":[]},"typography_font_weight":"600","typography_line_height":{"unit":"em","size":1.72,"sizes":[]},"border_radius":{"unit":"px","top":"None","right":"None","bottom":"None","left":"None","isLinked":false},"text_padding":{"unit":"px","top":"11","right":"21","bottom":"11","left":"21","isLinked":false},"_css_classes":"ml-btn-primary","_title":"Button","__globals__":{"background_color":"globals/colors?id=primary"}},"elements":[]}]}]},{"id":"af39a2","elType":"container","settings":{"padding":{"unit":"px","top":"38","right":"30","bottom":"44","left":"30","isLinked":false},"padding_mobile":{"unit":"px","top":"56","right":"30","bottom":"56","left":"30","isLinked":false},"flex_gap":{"unit":"px","size":"24","column":"24","row":"24","isLinked":true},"flex_align_items":"stretch","_element_id":"clients","css_classes":"ml-inner  ml-rule-top ml-rule-bottom","_title":"Client logos"},"elements":[{"id":"aefbc4","elType":"widget","widgetType":"heading","settings":{"title":"Research organizations, think tanks and NGOs we work with